      "mentions": [
        "char_li_jun_ying",
        "char_zhao_lian_yun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Bai Qing later confirms the same: Li Jun Ying secretly became a shadow path great grandmaster, kept a low profile, and used that cover to alter Gu materials in a plot against Feng Jin Huang.",
      "chapters": [
        2091
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_bai_qing",
        "char_feng_jin_huang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Star Constellation Immortal Venerable explains that Sun Yuan Hua’s human path comprehension resonated with the inheritance of Heavenly Court’s former shadow path Gu Immortal Immortal Monarch Gu Ying, yielding the Immortal Gu recipe of shadow puppet Gu. In that inheritance Gu Ying states that although shadow path is only a small branch of dark path now, it has more potential: it is also part of light path, because there is no shadow without light, and if it develops it could fuse light path and dark path into a larger path.",
      "chapters": [
        2284
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "branch-of-dark-and-light",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
